id: spectral-monster-first-effect
name: Spectral Monster
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCostPerBaseTier: 6
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: spectral-monster
fromEffect: 1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Spectral Monster's first effect, as a Maneuver: 1 Action and 6(bT) Ki - the Incorporeal Special State.
text: >
  (1)-[1/Round]: As a Standard Action with an Action Cost of 1 Action and a Ki Point Cost of 6(bT), enter the Incorporeal Special State.

---

# Refused while the Incorporeal State's own (2) keeps you out of it (chat.mjs spectralEnter).
[on used]
spectralEnter();
